    "title": "How long does an LED screen last? Lifespan, maintenance schedule and common faults",
    "titleFr": "Combien de temps dure un écran LED ? Durée de vie, maintenance et pannes courantes",
    "read": "11 MIN READ",
    "date": "01 SEP 2026",
