    "title": "Kinetic LED screens explained: how moving LED walls add physical depth to digital content",
    "titleFr": "Écrans LED cinétiques expliqués : comment les murs mobiles ajoutent de la profondeur physique au contenu",
    "read": "8 MIN READ",
    "date": "31 JUL 2026",
